        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: Inglis Barracks bombing, Brighton hotel bombing\n- Organizations: IRA, Conservative Party\n- People: Patrick Magee, Margaret Thatcher\n- Places: England, hotel\n\nFacts:\n- The 1984 Brighton hotel bombing was an IRA attack in which IRA member Patrick Magee planted a long-delay time bomb in a hotel.\n- The purpose of the 1984 Brighton hotel bombing was to kill Prime Minister Margaret Thatcher and her cabinet while they were staying at the hotel for the Conservative Party conference.\n- The Inglis Barracks bombing was the first IRA attack in England since the 1984 Brighton hotel bombing.",
